###* {{quote-web|en|author=HarryBlank|work=w:SCP Foundation|title=Next to Nothing|date=8 September 2024|url=https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/44-next-to-nothing|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20241005000145/https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/44-next-to-nothing|archivedate=5 October 2024|accessdate=4 October 2024|passage=Pensak made an inarticulate shout of surprise, and O stepped away from the sudden precipice so hard that she collided with the back of the elevator, and yelped. Both of them '''drew''' their weapons, as they were trained to do when confronted with the unknown, and there was something almost touchingly naïve about that. About '''drawing''' down on a featureless void.}}
