===Adverb===
{{head|cy|adverb}}

# [[there]], [[yonder]], [[beyond]]
#: {{syn|cy|acw|hwnt}}
#: {{uxi|cy|Mae'n byw ochr '''draw''''r mynydd.|He/She lives on the '''other'''/'''far''' side of the mountain.}}
# [[over]]
#: {{uxi|cy|Dere '''draw''' ar ôl y gwaith.|Come '''over''' after work.}}

====Usage notes====
This adverb, originally the a soft-mutated form of {{m|cy|traw}}, is found almost exclusively as unmutatable {{m|cy|draw}} today except in literary contexts where forms such as aspirate-mutated {{m|cy|thraw}} may be encountered.

